{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Some state belongs to a pair of entities rather than to one: a unit likes another, a turret aims"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at a ship, a button sits on a panel. A "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"relation"}]},{"type":"text","text":" stores that kind of link, and the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"hierarchy","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the relation that makes trees of parents and children."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Link Entities with Relations","type":"heading","anchor":"Link-Entities-with-Relations"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Declare a relation as a type that conforms to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", then link a source entity to a target","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/relate(_:_:to:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and unlink it with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/unrelate(_:_:from:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". Read the links in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"either direction: ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/targets(_:of:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" lists what a source relates to, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/sources(_:of:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" lists what relates to a target.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A relation can carry values, one per link, such as the amount one entity owes another. It"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"chooses two behaviors with static properties:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation\/isExclusive","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" limits a source to one target, so relating it to a new target"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"replaces the old one."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation\/onTargetDespawn","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" says what despawning a target does to its sources: remove their"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"links, the default, or despawn them too."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A source holds its links in a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Targets","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" component, which you read and filter on like any other","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"component. To visit only the sources of one target, filter a query with ","type":"text"},{"code":".related(_:to:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"uses the world’s index of each target’s sources rather than walking every source.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Build a Hierarchy","type":"heading","anchor":"Build-a-Hierarchy"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The hierarchy is the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf"},{"text":" relation: exclusive, so each entity has at most one parent, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"despawning a parent despawns its children, and theirs in turn. Spawn an entity under a parent","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/spawn(_:childOf:)"},{"text":", or move an existing one with ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/addChild(_:to:)"},{"text":", which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"throws ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/CyclicHierarchy"},{"text":" rather than make an entity its own ancestor. Walk the tree with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/parent(of:)"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/children(of:)"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/ancestors(of:)"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/descendants(of:)"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because the hierarchy is a relation, the same query filters work on it:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".related(ChildOf.self, to: ship)"},{"type":"text","text":" visits the children of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ship"},{"type":"text","text":", and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".without(Targets<ChildOf>.self)"},{"type":"text","text":" visits the roots."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example aims a ship’s turret at a comet, then at a moon, and despawns the ship"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with its turret:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct AimsAt: Relation {","    static var isExclusive: Bool { true }","}","","var world = World()","let ship = world.spawn(Name(value: \"ship\"))","let turret = world.spawn(Name(value: \"turret\"), childOf: ship)","let comet = world.spawn(Name(value: \"comet\"))","let moon = world.spawn(Name(value: \"moon\"))","","world.relate(turret, AimsAt(), to: comet)","world.relate(turret, AimsAt(), to: moon)","print(world.targets(AimsAt.self, of: turret) == [moon])","\/\/ Prints \"true\"","","world.despawn(ship)","print(world.contains(turret), world.sources(AimsAt.self, of: moon).isEmpty)","\/\/ Prints \"false true\""],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Observers of an "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntityEvent","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" that propagates also use the hierarchy: the event moves from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entity it was triggered on up to each of its ancestors. "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Commands","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" record changes to relations"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and to the hierarchy, to apply after a query or update."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/relatingentities"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"Relating Entities","role":"article","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/RelatingEntities","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"Link entities to one another, build trees of parents and children, and query entities by what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"they’re linked to.","type":"text"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AncestorsView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/DescendantsView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/CyclicHierarchy","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/HierarchyError"],"anchor":"Building-Hierarchies","title":"Building Hierarchies","generated":true}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Commands":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Commands","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A buffer of changes to a world, recorded now and applied later in the order they were"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"recorded."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Commands","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/commands","title":"Commands","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Commands"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/unrelate(_:_:from:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/unrelate(_:_:from:)","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Removes the link between a source entity and a target entity and returns its value."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/unrelate(_:_:from:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"unrelate","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"R","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"R"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"R"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"title":"unrelate(_:_:from:)"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/DescendantsView":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DescendantsView","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A lazy sequence of an entity’s descendants, depth-first.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DescendantsView","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/descendantsview","title":"DescendantsView","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/DescendantsView"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/addChild(_:to:)":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"addChild"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"text":"to","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"CyclicHierarchy","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule15CyclicHierarchyV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Adds an entity to the end of another entity’s children."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/addchild(_:to:)","title":"addChild(_:to:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/addChild(_:to:)"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/AncestorsView":{"abstract":[{"text":"A lazy sequence of an entity’s ancestors, from its parent up to the root of its tree.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/ancestorsview","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AncestorsView"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AncestorsView","title":"AncestorsView","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AncestorsView"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/addChild(_:checkedTo:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Adds an entity to the end of another entity’s children, throwing if either entity is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stale."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/addChild(_:checkedTo:)","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"addChild","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"checkedTo","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"HierarchyError","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule14HierarchyErrorO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"title":"addChild(_:checkedTo:)","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/addchild(_:checkedto:)","role":"symbol"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Relation/onTargetDespawn":{"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/relation\/ontargetdespawn","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"onTargetDespawn"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule13Clean